[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To load the if_pair kernel module now:

  kldload if_pair

To load it at boot, add to /boot/loader.conf:

  if_pair_load="YES"

Create a pair with `ifconfig pair create`; see if_pair(4) for details,
including the MTU CONFIGURATION section.  Developer notes — including
a checksum-offload interaction with in-kernel NAT (ipfw nat/ng_nat)
and its workaround — are in NOTES.md installed with the package
documentation (share/doc/if_pair).
EOM
}
]
